{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_066_1001_p", "source_sha256": "d6cc77c526b3084a5bbc8605b838378628605546cd7c415a6f34222318724e44", "ja": "おはよう、みんな！\n律子、ちょっと頼みたいことが……ん？", "zh": "早上好，大家！\n律子，有件事想拜托你……嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_066_1002_009rit", "source_sha256": "cb3ee6aa57c4df0077e716221370269838c7f9f16f9cbb20a6766661b41f1f60", "ja": "……うと、うと……。", "zh": "……呼……呼……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_066_1003_023aka", "source_sha256": "cec4d33a91d9df80574858aaac7e7888927d097479f8e12870e21e5532e7b605", "ja": "{$P$}ちゃん、チャンスだ！\n律子さんは油断してるぞ！！", "zh": "{$P$}，机会来了！律子小姐正疏于防备！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_066_1004_012mam", "source_sha256": "199f5684e474aac1c2749da3ac1ecca9228918646191bb95f1916bef2b87af8d", "ja": "んっふっふ～。今ならイタズラし放題、\nセク何とかハラし放題！　ビッグチャーンス！", "zh": "嗯哼哼～。现在可以随便恶作剧，\n想怎么性什么骚扰就怎么骚扰！大好机～会！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_066_1005_p", "source_sha256": "361607d291c691cf173c8e9b79248e285098b8afebd3b191030931e13649b61d", "ja": "チャンスじゃない！　真美、その手つきはやめなさい！\nおーい、律子。律子ってば！", "zh": "这可不是机会！真美，别再用那种手势了！\n喂——律子。律子——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_066_1006", "source_sha256": "5d8a8ef2b4c554ef60d60b7c6cd0b039fc2f05f8033a79cafe899a8cc8a5f472", "ja": "肩をゆする", "zh": "摇动肩膀", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_066_2000_009rit", "source_sha256": "8d5f1c1898e3fa382c2fa66456a59c16c4f8327b393ce7a020ea7acf184a297d", "ja": "あ……ひゃっ、{$P$}！？\nな、なんです、いきなり。セクハラで訴えますよ！？", "zh": "啊……呀，{$P$}！？\n怎、怎么突然这样。我要以性骚扰起诉你哦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_066_2001_p", "source_sha256": "7b8f014c05701599ffd9dfcbd74e38026025208e69015391d62b9e69d78c56f2", "ja": "起こしただけだし、止めた側なんだけどな……。\nそれより、大丈夫か？", "zh": "我只是把你叫醒了，而且还是制止那件事的人啊……\n比起这个，你没事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_066_2002_009rit", "source_sha256": "ab4ce2b80c1376c65d148827db622a17c151ff83625a0df25c17f8592b0d1fdd", "ja": "え？　あ、私、寝ちゃって……。", "zh": "诶？啊，我睡着了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_066_2003_012mam", "source_sha256": "da9e2221b6e5041dde2310488bd2b1aab0d5b1ad5b8911a0fc74d865ef3e8c2e", "ja": "リツコお嬢さん、オツカレですなぁ。\nこのところお忙しいようで。", "zh": "律子小姐，辛苦了呀。最近好像很忙呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_066_2004_023aka", "source_sha256": "95d03e8b6b598c9e126e2e72ffe6e5bcea4fb14862724904bbcec07a1f70f070", "ja": "あ、茜ちゃんのマッサージ受けてみる？\n開発中の茜ちゃんツボ押し器、効果抜群だよ！", "zh": "啊，要不要试试小茜的按摩？\n还在开发中的小茜穴位按压器，效果特别好哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_066_2005_009rit", "source_sha256": "ab72f7f78bc3f309a8dcf29b0e277bb5b11f751c1cb500d95ebaf5412aef1280", "ja": "だから、そういうのはいいの！\nそれより、ご用ですか？　{$P$}？", "zh": "所以，那种东西就算了！\n话说回来，您找我有事吗？{$P$}？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_066_2006_p", "source_sha256": "1c46990bfc1918ecc0d5928b549963474e841d331e70d397d8a258d28a1b2790", "ja": "ああ、実は……前に言ってただろ？\n劇場の公演企画、やってみたいって。", "zh": "啊，其实……我之前说过吧？\n想试着策划剧场公演来着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_066_2007_p", "source_sha256": "a40b21d1ead30a4306b9b4ca25d329655df040fc21b1a442bfb096a815eec33a", "ja": "だから、次回の公演企画を任せてみようかな、\nなんて思ったんだけど……。", "zh": "所以，我在想，要不要把下一场公演的企划交给你来负责……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_066_2008_009rit", "source_sha256": "8fd15c5f0ca4bd6448a585877234e16f0351b4f81bce625ec092b05f555e17d5", "ja": "え、本当ですか！？　ありがとうございます！\nもちろん、やりますよ。やらせてください！", "zh": "诶，真的吗！？谢谢你！\n当然，我会做的。请让我来吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_066_2009_009rit", "source_sha256": "0dba5cad9ac96bfdaaeb9b463b052e132697f3071529e8912c0faa5ef56c8aa3", "ja": "それじゃあ……まずはセンターを決めないとね。\n誰がいいかしら。うーんと……、あ。", "zh": "那么……首先得决定谁来当C位才行。\n选谁好呢。嗯……啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_066_2010_028ari", "source_sha256": "9bc459c24eef943fc167054d9d0a94629844a8922fb500bedaae5610f329811c", "ja": "はっ……どうしたんでしょう。律子さんが、偶然\n通りかかったありさたちを……み、見つめています！", "zh": "啊……这是怎么回事。律子小姐正盯着偶然路过的我们……正、正盯着看呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_066_2011_019min", "source_sha256": "23ca5507cf78baefc46595f42ee7324a5ffa9dff7a9b376acab30937e915e765", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さんもいるね♪\nもしかしたら、私達の出番なのかも！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生也在呢♪\n说不定轮到我们上场了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_066_2012_009rit", "source_sha256": "48b1f33e998d5d0fb37d09c3afada199cccdb2c3d6238ef0fca56148ecfef53a", "ja": "うん、ふたりなら、ファンの心をバッチリ掴んだ\n楽しい公演をやれそうよね。となると……。", "zh": "嗯，如果是她们两个的话，感觉能办一场\n牢牢抓住粉丝的心、开开心心的公演呢。这么说来……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_066_2013_023aka", "source_sha256": "8c70f1abd3e51fde7c9cc88a9d14aa990011104471264d81b2f451011d40bf4d", "ja": "ねえねえ律子さん、ここにもファンの心をワシ掴みに\nできる美少女アイドルがいるよ？　ほら、ほらほら！", "zh": "呐呐，律子姐，这里也有能牢牢抓住粉丝心的美少女偶像哦？你看，你看嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_066_2014_012mam", "source_sha256": "d18e0ea0bbe7bc987570528357c27f894d237d5fc6405da4af8fec1c7f943e37", "ja": "律っちゃんてば、もったいぶることないっしょ？\n素直に「真美、センターよろよろ」って言ってごらん？", "zh": "律子姐真是的，不用这么卖关子吧？\n老老实实说一句“真美，C位就拜托拜托啦”，怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_066_2015_p", "source_sha256": "1e8b0ea3383d0d40707a92540e744308bfde7e23ddd280ff99365f2382982007", "ja": "いや……違うんだ。律子に、次のセンターを\n考えてほしかったわけじゃなくて。", "zh": "不……不是那样的。我并不是想让律子\n去考虑下一任C位的人选。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_066_2016_p", "source_sha256": "87be0e56e3f16b3f54f2fba1d65c8abdecf179852d3006d1babefc781059e9f6", "ja": "次の公演のセンターを、律子に頼もうと思ったんだ。", "zh": "我是想拜托律子担任下一场公演的中心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_066_2017_009rit", "source_sha256": "b523f58bc6f5bac29db8ab7746a0cd242c07f46a7a658fe45bf0e1c002cf1655", "ja": "え？　次の公演のセンターを……、えっ？", "zh": "诶？下次公演的C位……诶？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_066_2018_009rit", "source_sha256": "a138d54d2b2eed68200654a72b55f46418a08b39a717f4ac94dd457c42c8d160", "ja": "わ、私！？　私がセンターですか！　そんな、\nいきなり言われても、その……ほら、心の準備が！", "zh": "我、我吗！？由我来当C位吗！怎么会，\n就算您突然这么说，那个……您看，我还没做好心理准备呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_066_2019_p", "source_sha256": "01303319f2579a9232c2974aba13fcc49c71cdf1b18e3e21f3a675f1a0ccd462", "ja": "まだ時間はたっぷりあるから、いきなりじゃないぞ。\nでも……。もしかして今、疲れてるのか？", "zh": "时间还充裕得很，不算突然吧。\n不过……莫非你现在很累吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_066_2020_p", "source_sha256": "876fb0830db25b9d73023ea5e778d22c487da17bb30c76cdb86a97adf52394a1", "ja": "だったら、またの機会にしても、\nまあいいんだけど……。", "zh": "那就改天再说也行，嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_066_2021_009rit", "source_sha256": "894f4c570e73eab5dbd6aac36785ae85eff4dcc053d1c362a7a2c9c451b05d77", "ja": "そうね、ちょっと疲れてもいるし……。公演、\nやりたいですよ？　やりたいけど、今はちょっと～。", "zh": "是啊，我也有点累了……。演出我当然想办啊？想办是想办，可是现在嘛，还是有点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_066_2022_012mam", "source_sha256": "a57171d86b135706eb7d231b5d3567ec43583708517b59cef806520c7230ad6f", "ja": "え～。じゃあ、いつならいいの、律っちゃん？\n真美も律っちゃんの公演、早くみたいよ～。", "zh": "欸～。那什么时候才行嘛，律子？真美也想早点看律子的演出哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_066_2023_009rit", "source_sha256": "3744167b39aef4099eea778566d0c24ace6a8bd7608249523d27d9ff9c44c900", "ja": "ま、真美……。", "zh": "真、真美……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_066_2024_019min", "source_sha256": "01543d7b86c0c420cc835cb5d9198ec534a8f9ea4912938fe9e4494cb6321042", "ja": "疲れをとるには、たくさん食べるのが一番ですよ！\nおなかが空いたら、いつでも言ってくださいね♪", "zh": "要消除疲劳，最重要的就是多吃东西！\n肚子饿了的话，随时都可以告诉我哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_066_2025_028ari", "source_sha256": "03de927088393e8551d5a2cebb83db78719b3b4ee3e7a071a66c61f45b3fc3f1", "ja": "劇場の客席を新緑の森に変える、律子センパイの\nセンター公演……！　ありさ、高まって来ました！", "zh": "将剧场的观众席变成新绿森林的律子前辈中心公演……！亚利沙越来越兴奋了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_066_2026_023aka", "source_sha256": "16a6606fa171e40bca381d4580e8146a879462a41f1e9019b9655a9346908213", "ja": "そうだよね。ファンのみんなも楽しみにしてるよね！\nあ、ちなみに茜ちゃんも超楽しみデス☆", "zh": "对吧。粉丝们也都很期待呢！啊，顺带一提，小茜也超级期待哦☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_066_2027_009rit", "source_sha256": "460cd81495bebdc02888c1097b9d59573ba78cad393eafbffdc22d5ee66ac5fd", "ja": "か……。\n考えさせてくださいっ。", "zh": "啊……让我考虑一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_066_2028_se", "source_sha256": "5eb294583bc6f40ad4e1df90eb85c503fc9ab6b6afb330bcf1c8be5b6f361216", "ja": "タッタッタ……", "zh": "哒哒哒……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_066_2029_023aka", "source_sha256": "b1e592d64b237d3c037f78fcaf36c90591ac6ef17b7ef029881a3fc254cb3462", "ja": "あれ……あれれ？　{$P$}ちゃん、\nもしかして茜ちゃん、よけいなこと言っちゃった？", "zh": "哎……哎呀？{$P$}，\n难不成小茜说了什么多余的话吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_066_2030_p", "source_sha256": "7d06f686f5feb10659e4bf0641d054eff630414422d5da0c363851c5f95c600a", "ja": "いや、たぶん大丈夫だよ。律子らしいというか……\nまあでも、実際疲れがたまってるんだろうな。", "zh": "不，应该没事的。这很像律子的作风……\n不过，她实际上确实积累了不少疲劳吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_066_2031_012mam", "source_sha256": "761d91dd3311ce451dc81a812fa2c531a068ae26d853fd43d7ae0e33b8c9e054", "ja": "そっか～。兄ちゃん、きっと律っちゃんには\nリフラッシュが必要なんだね？", "zh": "这样啊～。哥哥，律子姐一定是需要“刷新”一下吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_066_2032_p", "source_sha256": "c5819224e4f1b9cddfe08ab9e07a5681f755e487d96d4fdccb589fc23706696a", "ja": "ああ、リフレッシュだけど。\n……よし。みんな、ちょっと協力してくれないか？", "zh": "嗯，是“放松”啦。\n……好。大家能不能帮我一下？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
